  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {保冷|ほれい}{剤|ざい} (ice pack, freezer pack)\n- {保冷|ほれい}⟦バッグ→バッグ：00008_baggu⟧ (cooler bag)\n- {保冷|ほれい}⟦{車|しゃ}→車：09874_sha⟧ (refrigerated truck)\n- {保冷|ほれい}⟦{効果|こうか}→効果：02726_kouka⟧ (cold-retaining effect)\n\nCULTURAL NOTE:\nAt supermarkets and cake shops, staff often ask how long the trip home is and add {保冷|ほれい}{剤|ざい} to match.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{保温|ほおん}→保温：17467_hoon⟧: keeping warm (the counterpart)\n- ⟦{冷蔵|れいぞう}→冷蔵：11731_reizou⟧: refrigeration in a fridge",
